+ 
+ /* A popover is one card and throws a drop deeper than anything ever stands under
+    it. Four of them in a column is not four shadows: the drop is longer than the
+    gap between the rows, so they pool into one dark box standing behind the whole
+    stack. A toast throws a shorter, lighter one, and it is said as the same
+    variable the glass reads, so nothing here invents a second shadow. */
+ .toast-card {
+   --glass-shadow:
